flowchart LR
  subgraph OFFLINE[Offline indexing]
    KB[data/knowledge_base<br/>PDF DOCX MD TXT] --> DP[Document processing<br/>load - clean - chunk - validate - dedupe]
    DP --> EMB[Embedding<br/>LSA / TF-IDF / sentence-transformers<br/>L2-normalised]
    EMB --> IDX[FAISS IndexFlatIP]
    IDX --> ART[(artifacts/index<br/>index.faiss chunks.jsonl manifest.json)]
  end
  subgraph ONLINE[Online question answering]
    Q[User question] --> RET[Retriever<br/>embed query + top-k cosine]
    RET --> PB[Prompt builder<br/>rules + delimited passages]
    PB --> GEN[Generator<br/>extractive / Anthropic / Ollama]
    GEN --> ANS[Answer + [S#] citations + sources]
  end
  ART -.loaded at query time.-> RET
